    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List I</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Rectifier</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Used either for stepping up or stepping down the A.C. voltage</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Stabilizer</td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Used to convert A.C. voltage into D.C. voltage</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Transformer</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Used to remove any ripple in the rectified output voltage</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Filter</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Used for constant output voltage even when the input voltage or load current change</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
